# Model files larger than ~50 MB should use Git LFS (see .gitattributes).
# After re-training with retrain_all_tracks_sigmoid.py the RF models should
# all be < 5 MB (max_depth=10) and can be committed directly.
# If a .pkl exceeds 50 MB, do NOT commit it — use Git LFS or external storage.
